</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Carr’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$1.33m</strong>, taken from the <strong>$3.32m</strong> he is contracted to earn this season. He has not been paid an NBA salary before this year.</p>
<p>He played at Baylor and the Lakers took him 24th in the 2026 draft. He was 21 on draft night.</p>

