<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/cameron-carr/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/cameron-carr/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Cameron Carr’s Salary at the Lakers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carr earns $3.32m in 2026-27, eleventh on the Lakers payroll and the first season of his career. It is the whole of his earnings so far. The salary is 1.69% of the club’s $196.70m payroll and 2.01% of the league salary cap."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Cameron Carr Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Three seasons remain after this one, worth about $13.51m in total. The second is guaranteed and the last two are team options, with deadlines in October 2027 and October 2028."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Cameron Carr Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $3.32m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Cameron Carr’s Contract at the Lakers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carr signed a four-year contract worth $16.82m with the Lakers on July 2, 2026 on the rookie scale, of which $6.8m is guaranteed. The third and fourth seasons are team options with deadlines of October 31, 2027 and October 31, 2028. He would reach restricted free agency in 2030 at 25."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Cameron Carr’s Net Worth Today?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carr’s net worth is estimated at around $1.33m, taken from the $3.32m he is contracted to earn this season. He has not been paid an NBA salary before this year. He played at Baylor and the Lakers took him 24th in the 2026 draft. He was 21 on draft night."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Cameron Carr Paid on the Rookie Scale?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carr is paid $3.32m because the rookie scale fixes the figure for the 24th pick, and a player entering the league has no say in it. His four-year contract is worth about what Dončić earns in four months."}}]}</script>
